    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>313844</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSS_039_020_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>見つけてくれて
サンキュー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, you found me!
Thank you~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Don't know how ridiculous you want this to be - update as appropriate.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>313844</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSS_039_020_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ご褒美よ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here, a reward!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Don't know how ridiculous you want this to be - update as appropriate.</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>313928</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSS_039_020_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……では、サラバっ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...And with that... Farewell!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Replicated what was present in another translation</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あたしは悪いことを
しているわけではないザマス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, I've done
nothing wrong.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>金を借りたい人間と
貸したい人間のバランスが
上手に取れてるわけザマスよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, I've only skillfully established
an ideal balance between those who
borrow money and those who lend it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>食材屋「あじおう」
とんとたっぷり
見てってくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grocery store, "Flavor
King." Take a nice,
long, satisfying look!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見るだけは
よしとくれよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No window
shopping, please.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305524</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見るだけで
腹膨らかしてるんじゃ
ないよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You won't fill your
stomachs just by
looking, you know?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>腹が減っては
戦ができん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can't fight on
an empty stomach.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>闘技場へ行く前に
ここでみんな
腹ごしらえの材料を買う</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Everyone buys ingredients for
their pre-Arena meals from here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、腹が膨れても
勇気は出ないのな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, even when I fill my stomach,
I still can't work up much courage.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>腹が減るから
考え方がネガティブになるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When my stomach's empty,
my thoughts turn negative.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>腹が膨れれば、
ポジティブな自分が
想像できるようになる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But when I fill it, I
can imagine a
more positive me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いくら
腹をいっぱいにして
ポジティブになっても……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But however much I
eat and however
positive my thoughts...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>実力が伴わなきゃ
闘技場へはいけないか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If I'm still not a real warrior, I still
can't really fight in the Arena...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いらはいいらはい、
食材屋「マリオン」だ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Welkies, welkies, this is
the grocery store, "Marion"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほれほれ
見てった、買ってった！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, hey, look
a lot, buy a lot!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それそれ、おいでおいで
うまいもの、とりそろえてるよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well then, well then, come again, come again!
We have all the most delicious things~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もともと「シグルド」ってのは
魔物を狩ったり、町の祭りを
しきったりする組織だった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Originally, those "Sigurd" guys were
an organization for monster hunting,
managing town fairs, that sort of thing.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつからだろうな、
あんな暴力集団に
落ちてしまったのは</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So how and when did they
fall so far, and end up as just
a bunch of violent thugs?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>国家に認められない非合法組織と
いう烙印を押されてしまったのが
この転落の始まりだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This country branded them as
an illegal organization. That
must have been how it started.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>別に何も悪いことは
してなかったと思うが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't think they'd done anything
particularly wrong up until then, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「シグルド」も哀れな連中だよ。
妙な思想に取りつかれなきゃ
もっとうまくやれたろうに</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They're a pitiful bunch, really, "Sigurd."
If not for the strange ideology they've
latched onto, they'd be doing really well.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もっとも古株の連中は
早くに抜けて違う組織を
立ち上げたって話だけどな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've heard their oldest veterans left
the group pretty quick and formed
their own organization, though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>憎しみは何も生まん、
暴力じゃ何も解決せんよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nothing gains life from hatred,
and nothing is solved by violence.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、何にせよ、
ヴァルハラが解放されてよかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, at any rate, it's good that
Valhalla's been liberated.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305564</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「シグルド」のリーダーになった
ブレイナーってのは
あのバジル博士だったんだってな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Turns out Sigurd's latest leader,
Brynhildr, was really that professor
guy. Basil, I think his name was.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Basil-Hakase/Professor Basil</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305564</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やつらのやり方がスマート、
かつクールに合理的、そして
残酷になったのもわかるな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Their methods were smart, cool,
and logical. But I know they'd
become pretty cruel, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最近の「シグルド」は
実に狡猾で、力をつけたと
噂だった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Sigurd" had been growing in strength,
and using a lot more crafty methods
of late. Or that was the rumor.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ユークリッド騎士団を
動かしたほどだしな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So much so that the Euclid Knights
were forced to make a move.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まさか、バジル博士が
一枚噛んでたとは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Still can't believe that professor
had thrown in with them, though...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Basil-Hakase/Professor Basil</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>仕事は食材屋
屋号は「あじおう」</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Groceries are our work,
and "Flavor King"'s our name.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ささ、
買ってっておくれ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Come on, please buy somethin'~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>超逸品、新鮮素材！
ユークリッドにこの味あり！の
「あじおう」だよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The greatest quality in all the land! You
can find those fine flavors yourself,
right here in Euclid, at "Flavor King"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お腹が空くから腹が立つのよ
腹が立って
彼とケンカになるんだわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I get hungry, and that makes me
hangry! I even get in fights with
my boyfriend because of it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう思って半年……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...So I convinced myself,
for half a year, and then...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……太った……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I gained so much weight...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>せっかくオシャレのための
服を買ったのに
食べ過ぎて太って着られない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I bought nice clothes just to dress up,
and not long after... I realized I'd eaten
too much, and I couldn't get into them...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも彼ったらそんなの着なくても
充分キレイだよって
言ってくれるの∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But my boyfriend said I'm
already super pretty even
without those kinds of clothes! ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ダイエットして
５キロやせた……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I went on a diet
and lost 11 pounds...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>着られなかった服も
着られるようになって、
オシャレになったの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can fit into the clothes
I couldn't before, too...
I look so fashionable...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、どうして……
彼は私の下から去っていったの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, for some reason... My boyfriend
doesn't sleep with me anymore...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>彼は言ったの……
ぽっちゃりしてたおまえの方が
よかったよって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He did say... He liked
me when I was all
plump and pudgy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ウソでしょ！？
何よ、それ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's no way, right!?
He can't actually mean it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くそーっ！
食ってやる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dammit...! Then, I'll
just stuff myself!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>リバウンドで
１０キロ太っちゃった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've gained another 22
pounds of rebound weight...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見えないでしょ……？
着やせするタイプなの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can't tell, right...? I always
look much slimmer in clothes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぽっちゃりした子が
好きだよって言った彼は
戻ってこなかったけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My boyfriend said he
likes pudgy girls, but he
still hasn't come back, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいの、寛容な心で許すわ
だって今の私は
おおらかな女ですもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's fine. I have the tolerance to let
it go. After all, I'm a woman with a very,
very big, huge, humongous...um, heart.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
